flowchart TD
    A([Admin views Applications tab]) --> B[app.status === approved]
    B --> C[Mint NFT button visible\nbg-violet-600, disabled if isActing]

    C --> D([Admin clicks Mint NFT])
    D --> E[handleMint sets mintModal = app\nno network call yet]
    E --> F[Modal renders\nfixed overlay z-50\nbackdrop blur\nmax-w-md panel]

    F --> G{Admin action}

    G -- clicks Cancel or X button --> H[setMintModal null\nno state change\nno API call]
    G -- clicks backdrop --> H
    G -- presses Escape --> H

    G -- clicks Mint NFT confirm --> I[submitMint called\nsetMintModal null first\nsetActionLoading appId]

    I --> J[POST /api/v1/nft-applications/:courseId/:appId/mint]
    J --> K{API response}

    K -- success --> L[setApplications: merge updated app\nstatus becomes minted\ntxHash populated\nactionLoading cleared]
    K -- error --> M[setActionError for row\nactionLoading cleared\nrow shows error text in red]

    L --> N[Row now shows Minted badge\ntxHash link to stellar.expert]
    M --> O[Row shows inline error\nMint NFT button still visible if re-attempt needed]
